SUMMARY:Meditation in the Orchard with Joy Jacobsen at Gold Ridge Organic Farms
DESCRIPTION:Start your Sunday with a peaceful introduction to meditation in the tranquil setting of our olive orchard. Led by registered yoga teacher\, Joy Jacobsen\, this session offers an opportunity to simply be with yourself\, surrounded by nature\, listening to the gentle vibrations of the world in a safe\, peaceful\, and restorative space. \nWe’ll begin with a peaceful stroll to the orchard from our Farm Shop. Feel free to bring your own mat\, though we’ll also provide one if needed. Then we’ll move into gentle standing stretches and mindful breathing—essential practices that prepare the body to become limber\, relaxed\, and comfortable for stillness. As you settle into a 20-minute meditation\, Joy will hold space for your practice\, opening and closing the session with the soothing sound of a singing bowl. \nWe’ll conclude the experience back at the farm shop with fresh apple cider and sliced heirloom apples. \nJoy brings firsthand experience from training in Hatha and Vinyasa yoga in Goa\, India\, and from completing a three-week silent meditation retreat in Thailand. Her welcoming\, supportive approach creates an ideal environment for both experienced practitioners and those new to meditation. You’ll also find her warmth at Gold Ridge Organic Farms\, where she manages the Farm Shop and is a familiar\, friendly face to our community.
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/meditation-in-the-orchard-with-joy-jacobsen-at-gold-ridge-organic-farms/
LOCATION:Gold Ridge Organic Farms\, 3387 Canfield Rd\, Sebastopol\, 95472
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/IMG_0808-copy.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Gold Ridge Organic Farms":MAILTO:info@goldridgeorganicfarms.com
END:VEVENT
