SUMMARY:Live Music Fridays
DESCRIPTION:Spend a casual Friday evening enjoying live music & local wines at a small\, family owned & operated winery in The Barlow in downtown Sebastopol. \nFeatured artists are announced on a monthly basis to our email list and can be found on the events calendar on our website. \nFree entry. No reservations are required but Table Service can be booked in advance to ensure you get a seat. Our tasting room is family & dog friendly\, please feel free bring the whole crew!
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/live-music-fridays/2026-09-18/
