SUMMARY:The Art of Lap Loom Tapestry Weaving
DESCRIPTION:Learn the foundations of tapestry weaving with Hanna “The Wool Witch” in this beginner-friendly lap loom workshop. You’ll learn how to set up and warp a loom before experimenting with yarn\, wool roving\, denim scraps\, and other fibers to create texture and dimension in your own woven wall hanging. \nIn this workshop\, you’ll:\n* Learn how to prepare and warp a wooden lap loom\n* Practice foundational tapestry weaving techniques\n* Experiment with different fibers\, materials\, and textures\n* Create your own woven wall tapestry\n* Take home both your finished tapestry and the wooden lap loom you learned on so you can continue weaving \nNo prior weaving experience required. All materials are included.
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/the-art-of-lap-loom-tapestry-weaving/
